# The image needs docker/requirements-image.txt and the three gateway packages (Dockerfile COPY); docker-compose
# bind-mounts the same packages over them for local development.
# Keeping the rest out makes builds fast and keeps secrets (.env) out of the build context.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.git
.github
.venv
.venv-compression
venv
.vscode
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
reports
evals
monitoring
prompt_compression/eval
prompt_compression/dev
**/tests
**/pytest.ini
**/.ruff_cache
*.log
